  body: |
    # Mariner definition for other benefits in the source

    ## Authored interpretation

    The other-benefits definition describes shipboard roles and gives further connection and UK-contract conditions for employment in another capacity on board.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 078071–078072 use historical source wording and have a forces exception. It is not sufficient to identify anyone working on a vessel as a mariner for every benefit.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 078071, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f779940f0b6230268fabd/dmgch0707.pdf#page=5)
    - [DMG 078072, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f779940f0b6230268fabd/dmgch0707.pdf#page=5)

